1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,379
You know those aura farming edits

2
00:00:01,379 --> 00:00:02,740
that are all over your feed right now?

3
00:00:02,899 --> 00:00:05,139
The slow-mo, the dramatic lighting, this guy?

4
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,860
You can now make a clip just like this

5
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:08,539
from a single photo of yourself with Claude.

6
00:00:08,699 --> 00:00:10,439
Most people do this through a new Higgs Field tool

7
00:00:10,439 --> 00:00:11,119
called Katana.

8
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:13,820
Just connect Higgs Field to Claude, type slash Katana,

9
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,079
drop in your photo and then pick one of the edit styles.

10
00:00:16,339 --> 00:00:17,579
And then it'll just build it for you.

11
00:00:17,679 --> 00:00:19,359
If you want more than one character in there too,

12
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:21,219
you can also add up to five reference images

13
00:00:21,219 --> 00:00:22,100
and if a shot's missing,

14
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:23,820
it'll literally just generate it for you.

15
00:00:23,899 --> 00:00:24,920
So you don't even need all the footage

16
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:25,780
to get a finished edit.

17
00:00:25,879 --> 00:00:27,379
Comment Katana and I'll send you the link

18
00:00:27,379 --> 00:00:28,140
to try it yourselves.
